    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Action-Packed Roguelike, Sword-Wielding Chaos]</strong><br>Take on hundreds of enemies solo and slice your way through hordes of monsters like it's nobody's business;<br>With skills flashing across the screen and every hit landing with force, you'll feel the thrill both visually and mentally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Endless Skills, Ultimate Freedom in Combos]</strong><br>100+ skills, tons of transformations, and endless combo possibilities;<br>From sword attacks to lightning strikes and ice magic\u2014each playstyle comes with its own unique mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Strategic Battles, Endless Demon Sealing]</strong><br>Hundreds of levels with epic boss fights, no more repetitive content;<br>Dodge, weave, and face random events\u2014strategy is key, and you can win without spending a dime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Simple Progression, True Immortal Journey]</strong><br>No VIP system, just straightforward progression with a clear growth path;<br>Level up your spirit and experience the true journey of becoming an immortal.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Action-Packed Roguelike, Sword-Wielding Chaos]</strong><br>Take on hundreds of enemies solo and slice your way through hordes of monsters like it's nobody's business;<br>With skills flashing across the screen and every hit landing with force, you'll feel the thrill both visually and mentally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Endless Skills, Ultimate Freedom in Combos]</strong><br>100+ skills, tons of transformations, and endless combo possibilities;<br>From sword attacks to lightning strikes and ice magic\u2014each playstyle comes with its own unique mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Strategic Battles, Endless Demon Sealing]</strong><br>Hundreds of levels with epic boss fights, no more repetitive content;<br>Dodge, weave, and face random events\u2014strategy is key, and you can win without spending a dime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Simple Progression, True Immortal Journey]</strong><br>No VIP system, just straightforward progression with a clear growth path;<br>Level up your spirit and experience the true journey of becoming an immortal.</p>",
